{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EJEfwsLG4JpVcNRcVJrmd3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Anchor R&D Surface v3 â€” \"Mission Control\" â€” Execution Log\n2\t\n3\t> Foreman appends per-wave EXECUTE / GATE / REVIEW / FIX / JUDGE entries here.\n4\t> Seeded by the Crucibleâ†’Foreman handoff on 2026-06-11. Frozen design:\n5\t> `MASTER-PLAN.md`. Plan: `IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`. Gate: `python -m pytest -v`.\n6\t\n7\t## Handoff (2026-06-11)\n8\t\n9\t- Crucible Stage 0 (North Star locked), Stage 1 (Master Plan approved), Stage 2\n10\t  (10-wave plan, internal Shark-Tank converged given the Wave-1 ConPTY gate)\n11\t  complete.\n12\t- User-locked decisions: real ConPTY terminals (pywinpty; stdlib-only waiver for\n13\t  the terminal subsystem only); proactive cached summaries; git-worktree\n14\t  per-session isolation; one comprehensive build; **Wave-1 ConPTY-under-service\n15\t  spike HALTS to the user if it fails (no silent downgrade)**; status colors\n16\t  green=working / amber=needs-you-or-done / red=failed / grey=idle.\n17\t- Mid-Stage-2 addition: Wave 9 â€” brand the home page as a Ghost World Labs tool\n18\t  powered by NextGen Nuclear, using `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home\\GWL-M-Icon.svg` (ghost +\n19\t  â˜¢, palette matches the theme).\n20\t- Awaiting Foreman Wave 1 (the ConPTY-under-service spike â€” a hard gate).\n21\t\n22\t---\n23\t\n24\t## Wave 1 â€” ConPTY-under-service spike (HARD GATE) â€” GO (2026-06-11)\n25\t\n26\t**EXECUTE.** Created `pty_manager.py` (backend seam: real `pywinpty` backend +\n27\tdeterministic in-memory `stub` backend, env-selected by `ANCHOR_PTY_BACKEND`;\n28\t`winpty` imported LAZILY inside the pywinpty backend's `start` â€” `import\n29\tpty_manager` works with the native dep absent, surfacing `PtyUnavailable`).\n30\tManager core: `start/write/read_since/resize/kill`, cursor-stable like\n31\t`job_runner.tail`, `UnknownSession(KeyError)` on unknown ids, thread-safe live\n32\ttable. Added `tests/test_pty_